@startuml UC65_ExportExcel
!theme plain
title UC65: Xuất báo cáo Excel

actor Staff as "Staff/Admin"
participant "Admin Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB
participant "XLSX Library" as XLSX

Staff -> Frontend: Chọn bộ lọc\n(status, source, dateRange, amountRange)
Staff -> Frontend: Click "Xuất Excel"
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/bookings\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query params: filters)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role (staff/admin)
API -> DB: Query bookings với filters\n(populate guests, roomId, customerId, services)
DB --> API: Filtered bookings

Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/invoices\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query params: filters)
API -> DB: Query invoices với filters\n(populate bookingId, customerId)
DB --> API: Filtered invoices

Frontend -> Frontend: Tính toán thống kê từ dữ liệu đã lọc\n(totalBookings, revenue, paymentRate, etc.)

Frontend -> XLSX: Tạo workbook mới
XLSX --> Frontend: Workbook created

Frontend -> XLSX: Tạo sheet "Danh sách Booking"\n(convert bookings data to sheet)
XLSX --> Frontend: Sheet 1 created

Frontend -> XLSX: Tạo sheet "Thống kê"\n(statistics data)
XLSX --> Frontend: Sheet 2 created

Frontend -> XLSX: Tạo sheet "Phân tích" (nếu có)\n(customer analysis, trends)
XLSX --> Frontend: Sheet 3 created

Frontend -> XLSX: Xuất file Excel\n(filename: bookings_YYYY-MM-DD.xlsx)
XLSX --> Staff: Download file Excel

API --> Frontend: Success + data (bookings, invoices)
Frontend --> Staff: File Excel đã được tải xuống\n(dữ liệu báo cáo theo bộ lọc)
@enduml

